acceptance: A frame without action_path is Deny with no LiveEntry mutation. STATE_DELTA without action_path does not change element z. Forecast ingest without action_path does not write coordinates. CI fails if process_event mutates then envelope_admit returns Err for the same event. nla-policy-scan gate coding-completion and project-completion-bac on AEP-Base-Node/crate and AEP-Components/live-entry/crate before any ship prose.
